'《海韵黎纹紫金陶瓦猫》被（同年入围首届陶艺大赛）':'Tile Cat: Ocean Rhythm and Li Patterns, collected by the museum (shortlisted the same year for the 1st Ceramic Art Competition)',
'作品《进化论》入编知网收录的（年鉴银奖）':'The work Evolution included in the yearbook (Silver Award), indexed in CNKI',
